@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@taskId = REPLACE_WITH_ID_FROM_CREATE_RESPONSE

### Create: copy the returned id into taskId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Buy milk","priority":"High"}

### List all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Complete: repeat this request to get 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Invalid title: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"   "}
